OL,3,GNEWSADUP seeks to block law on
OL,4,AIrish-medium schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Democratic Unionist Party (DUP) has
OL,7,Ftabled a petition of concern in a bid
OL,8,Fto block proposed legislation on
OL,9,FIrish-medium education.
OL,11,FThe private member's bill, brought
OL,12,Fforward by Sinn Fein assembly member
OL,13,FPat Sheehan, would require Stormont's
OL,14,FDepartment of Education to prepare a
OL,15,Fworkforce plan on schools in the
OL,16,Fsector.
OL,18,FDUP leader Gavin Robinson said the
OL,19,Fpetition was the latest outworking of
OL,20,Ftheir response to Sinn Fein's
OL,21,F"arrogance" over the Drumcree parading
OL,22,Fdispute.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
