OL,3,GNEWSADUP seeks to block law on
OL,4,AIrish-medium schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FSheehan described the move as a
OL,7,F"disgraceful abuse" of the veto
OL,8,Fmechanism and accused the DUP of
OL,9,F"nothing but anti-Irish bigotry".
